# Lynx + Knowledge directory contract

**Canonical doctrine:** `docs/architecture/009-machine-layer-doctrine.md` (**ARCH-009**)
**Delivery plan:** `docs/roadmap/005-lynx-knowledge-substrate.md` (**TRACK-005**)

