## Boundary split

| Module | Role | Public door |
|---|---|---|
| **`@afenda/feature-knowledge`** | Substrate — pgvector, `knowledge_chunk`, embeddings, chunk CRUD, eval harness | `@afenda/feature-knowledge`, `@afenda/feature-knowledge/server`, `@afenda/feature-knowledge/client`, `@afenda/feature-knowledge/metadata` |
| **`@afenda/feature-lynx`** | Product — Truth Retrieval UI, streaming truth, Operator Assist | `@afenda/feature-lynx`, `@afenda/feature-lynx/server`, `@afenda/feature-lynx/client`, `@afenda/feature-lynx/metadata` |
| **`@afenda/ai`** | Provider-agnostic agent + tool layer | Stays substrate-blind — no import of `@afenda/feature-knowledge` |

`@afenda/feature-lynx` composes `@afenda/feature-knowledge` via barrel only — no deep imports.

