## Governed tool envelope

Every tool exported from `@afenda/ai` must carry:

```ts
type GovernedToolMeta = {
  risk: "low" | "medium" | "high";
  category: "contacts" | "knowledge" | "operations" | "approvals" | "records" | "documents";
  access: "read" | "write";
  dataSensitivity: "none" | "low" | "medium" | "high";
  audit: "silent" | "record";
};
```

- `audit: "record"` → emit structured audit entry per call.
- `access: "write"` → route through sandbox/approval flow, never direct table writes.
- Tool id list and meta must be stable — changes require extending tests that assert id order/membership.

